 "why_floorplan": "column h0 of the X SRAM tile as its own hard tile (237.6 x 432): 4 SRAM R0 at x 38.88 (read pins on the 37-um W channel), 90.72 pitch from y 43.2; its key half muxes down that channel to its kq pin band on the S face; clock at the S-face centre. sx_i / rst on the S face beside the clock (one pin-flop band; the W-face capture was the early 234-ps group of xmh1). Added 1024 local read capture flops (unreset), 64/128 one-hot delay bits. Readcap gates are placed beside macro read face; no new macro or boundary pin.",
